# .forceignore
# Controls what Salesforce CLI excludes when retrieving metadata FROM an org,
# or deploying metadata TO an org from this project. This is a Salesforce DX
# concept, separate from .gitignore, which only controls git.

# VS Code auto-generates these for LWC editor support (path resolution,
# IntelliSense). Not real Salesforce metadata, should never be deployed
# or pulled back from an org.
**/jsconfig.json
**/.eslintrc.json

# Jest unit test folders for LWC (if added later). These run locally or in
# CI, not in Salesforce itself, so there's nothing on the org side to
# deploy them to or retrieve them from.
**/__tests__/**
